=	render 'partials/modal', id: 'request-book-modal' do
	%form.w-full{data: {controller: 'request-book'}, class: '!m-0 !gap-0 !block'}
		%i.ph.ph-git-pull-request.mx-auto.w-fit.block.py-4.text-3xl
		.font-semibold.text-2xl.text-center.my-2{class: 'max-w-[300px] mx-auto'} Which book should we add next to Tomes?
		%p.text-secondary.text-sm.text-center Currently, we only host and publish public domain books.
		.flex.flex-col.gap-4.my-6.w-full
			.flex.flex-col.gap-2
				%label{for: 'book-title', class: 'label-field'} Book title
				%input{type: 'text', id: 'book-title', required: true, placeholder: "Enter the book's title", class: 'input-field h-11'}
			.flex.flex-col.gap-2
				%label{for: 'author-name', class: 'label-field'} Author name
				%input{type: 'text', id: 'author-name', required: true, placeholder: "Enter the author's name", class: 'input-field h-11'}
		.flex.w-full.justify-end.mt-2.gap-2.footer
			%button{type: 'button', class: 'btn btn-surface', 'data-micromodal-close': ''} Cancel
			-# .btn.btn-secondary.h-11 Request book